OL,3,GNEWSAMetro closure extended for bridge
OL,4,Aworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of railway will remain closed
OL,7,Ffor longer than planned while repairs
OL,8,Fare carried out on a Victorian bridge.
OL,10,FMetro services have been suspended
OL,11,Fbetween St James and Monkseaton since
OL,12,FSaturday for track renewal, but a
OL,13,Fclosure will remain in place between
OL,14,FWallsend and Tynemouth until Thursday
OL,15,Fas the bridge in North Shields requires
OL,16,F"immediate and substantial repairs".
OL,18,FKevin Storey, operations director at
OL,19,FMetro operator Nexus, said: "The scale
OL,20,Fof the work means that we must keep
OL,21,Fthis section of the line closed."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
